      "step_number": 4,
      "text": "Step 4: Applying the AM-GM inequality to \\(\\frac{625}{b^8}\\) and \\(b^8\\), we get:\n\\[\\frac{\\frac{625}{b^8} + b^8}{2} \\geq \\sqrt{\\frac{625}{b^8} \\cdot b^8} = \\sqrt{625} = 25.\\]\nThus,\n\\[\\frac{625}{b^8} + b^8 \\geq 2 \\times 25 = 50.\\]",
      "z": -0.33865960237674564
