      "step_number": 5,
      "text": "Step 5: Equality in the AM-GM inequality holds when \\(\\frac{625}{b^8} = b^8\\). Solving this equation, we get:\n\\[625 = b^{16} \\implies b^4 = 5 \\implies b = 5^{1/4}.\\]\nThen, substituting \\(b = 5^{1/4}\\) back into \\(a = \\frac{5}{b^2}\\), we get:\n\\[a = \\frac{5}{(5^{1/4})^2} = \\frac{5}{5^{1/2}} = 5^{1 - 1/2} = 5^{1/2} = \\sqrt{5}.\\]",
